/// Specifies a justification for the column, either LCJ_LEFT,
/// LCJ_CENTRE or LCJ_RIGHT.
///
/// LBNA_CheckBox (BOOL) (V41)
///
/// Means that this node will be a checkbox node, that can be toggled
